                                "sense_id": "f2348e3b-aa90-3b5f-8c15-eed68e4f2151",
                                "text": "What if she happened to meet him! Would he imagine her purpose in coming there? Her heart began to beat un-wontedly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a2803f3-17a6-4097-b06b-e2ad8b5aad09",
                                "sense_id": "f2348e3b-aa90-3b5f-8c15-eed68e4f2151",
                                "text": "\"My dear child,\" Mr. Jenkins said, and his voice was un-wontedly compassionate."
                            }
